{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This article describes the KeyboardKit emoji engine."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Emoji","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiCategory","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiContext","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiColonSearch","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiSettings","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiVersion"],"title":"Types"},{"anchor":"Views","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboard","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboardConfiguration","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboardSizes","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboardState","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboardStyle","doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiSearchField"],"title":"Views"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit has an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Emoji","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" struct that represents an plain emoji value, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiCategory"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiVersion","isActive":true},{"text":" types that let you fetch all available emojis from all available categories and versions.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"👑 The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboard"},{"type":"text","text":" and some other emoji features like "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiColonSearch"},{"text":" require a KeyboardKit Pro license with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/ProFeature\/emojiAddons"},{"text":" feature. You can sign up for KeyboardKit Pro from the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/keyboardkit.com"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important"},{"text":"Emojis","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Emojis"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Emoji","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" struct represents a type-safe emoji model that lets you work with emojis and their information in a more structured way:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let emoji = Emoji(\"😀\")","Emoji(\"👍\").unicodeIdentifier   \/\/ \\\\N{THUMBS UP SIGN}","Emoji(\"👍\").unicodeName         \/\/ Thumbs Up Sign","Emoji(\"👍\").hasSkinToneVariants      \/\/ true","Emoji(\"🚀\").hasSkinToneVariants      \/\/ false","Emoji(\"👍🏿\").neutralSkinToneVariant   \/\/ 👍","Emoji(\"👍\").skinToneVariants         \/\/ 👍👍🏻👍🏼👍🏽👍🏾👍🏿","","\"Hello!\".containsEmoji           \/\/ false","\"Hello! 👋\".containsEmoji        \/\/ true","\"Hello! 👋\".containsOnlyEmojis   \/\/ false","\"Hello! 👋😀\".emojis             \/\/ [\"👋\", \"😀\"]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can trigger emoji character insertion by triggering the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardAction\/emoji(_:)-swift.enum.case","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keyboard action, just like you trigger any other keyboard action."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiCategory","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines standard emoji categories and their emojis, while the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiVersion","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" defines all available emoji versions, to let KeyboardKit filter out unavailable emojis, to avoid displaying empty placeholders on older OS versions."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Context","type":"heading","anchor":"Context"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit has an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiContext","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class with observable state and auto-persisted "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiContext\/settings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", that can be used to customize the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and its behavior."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit automatically creates an instance of this class and registers it with its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardInputViewController\/state","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and also injects it into the view environment."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Localization","type":"heading","anchor":"Localization"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Emoji","type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiCategory","type":"reference"},{"text":" enums can be localized in any locale that has translations:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let emoji = Emoji(\"😀\") ","emoji.localizedName                   \/\/ Grinning Face","emoji.localizedName(in: .swedish)     \/\/ Leende Ansikte","","let category = EmojiCategory.animalsAndNature ","category.localizedName                \/\/ Animals & Nature","category.localizedName(in: .swedish)  \/\/ Djur och natur"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Take a look at ","type":"text"},{"code":"Resources\/en.lproj\/Localizable.strings","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to see how you can localize emojis for more keyboard locales.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Search","anchor":"Search","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit unlocks an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiColonSearch","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" engine that makes can be used to search for emojis by starting words with a colon. This is used by the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Autocomplete\/StandardAutocompleteService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to enable emoji autocomplete suggestions."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiSearchField","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be used to provide emoji search in the keyboard. The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" uses this the top toolbar view, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" will replace the autocomplete toolbar with an emoji search field when the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/InputType\/emojiSearch","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" input type is activated."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Settings","anchor":"Settings","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardKit has an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiSettings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" type with emoji-related settings like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiSettings\/preferredSkinTones","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Other settings types have emoji-related settings, like the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/AutocompleteSettings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/AutocompleteSettings\/isEmojiAutocompleteEnabled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" setting."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The context "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.keyboardkit.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiContext\/settings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is used by default. "}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Views","anchor":"Views","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[